text":"적합하다.","x":427,"y":1322,"width":121,"height":33}]},{"text":"기본적으로 반복과 순환은 문제 해결 능력이 같으며 많은 경우에 순환 알고리즘을 반복 버전","words":[{"text":"기본적으로","x":209,"y":1378,"width":143,"height":32},{"text":"반복과","x":364,"y":1378,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"순환은","x":461,"y":1378,"width":89,"height":31},{"text":"문제","x":561,"y":1379,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"해결","x":634,"y":1379,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"능력이","x":705,"y":1380,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"같으며","x":808,"y":1380,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"많은","x":910,"y":1380,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"경우에","x":982,"y":1379,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"순환","x":1082,"y":1380,"width":62,"height":31},{"text":"알고리즘을","x":1155,"y":1380,"width":146,"height":33},{"text":"반복","x":1313,"y":1381,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"버전","x":1384,"y":1379,"width":56,"height":33}]},{"text":"으로, 반복 알고리즘을 순환 버전으로 바꾸어 쓸 수 있다.특히 순환 호출이 끝에서 이루어지는","words":[{"text":"으로,","x":175,"y":1434,"width":64,"height":32},{"text":"반복","x":256,"y":1433,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"알고리즘을","x":327,"y":1433,"width":144,"height":32},{"text":"순환","x":483,"y":1433,"width":61,"height":31},{"text":"버전으로","x":557,"y":1433,"width":118,"height":32},{"text":"바꾸어","x":688,"y":1435,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"쓸","x":791,"y":1435,"width":31,"height":32},{"text":"수","x":834,"y":1436,"width":30,"height":31},{"text":"있다.특히","x":879,"y":1434,"width":124,"height":33},{"text":"순환","x":1020,"y":1434,"width":62,"height":32},{"text":"호출이","x":1093,"y":1435,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"끝에서","x":1194,"y":1435,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"이루어지는","x":1296,"y":1435,"width":146,"height":33}]},{"text":"순흰을 꼬리 순환(tail recumon)이라 하는데, 이를 반복 알고리즘으로 쉽게 바꾸어 쓸 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"순흰을","x":176,"y":1488,"width":86,"height":31},{"text":"꼬리","x":273,"y":1488,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"순환(tail","x":341,"y":1488,"width":112,"height":33},{"text":"recumon)이라","x":465,"y":1488,"width":203,"height":33},{"text":"하는데,","x":678,"y":1489,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"이를","x":792,"y":1490,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"반복","x":862,"y":1490,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"알고리즘으로","x":933,"y":1489,"width":178,"height":32},{"text":"쉽게","x":1122,"y":1490,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"바꾸어","x":1192,"y":1490,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"쓸","x":1290,"y":1490,"width":31,"height":31},{"text":"수","x":1331,"y":1491,"width":30,"height":31},{"text":"있다.","x":1374,"y":1489,"width":63,"height":33}]},{"text":"그러나 순환은 어떤 문제에서는 반복에 비해 알고리즘을 훨씬 명확하고 간결하게 나타낼 수 있","words":[{"text":"그러나","x":176,"y":1542,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"순환은","x":273,"y":1543,"width":89,"height":31},{"text":"어떤","x":374,"y":1543,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"문제에서는","x":442,"y":1542,"width":148,"height":32},{"text":"반복에","x":603,"y":1543,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"비해","x":706,"y":1544,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"알고리즘을","x":777,"y":1544,"width":149,"height":31},{"text":"훨씬","x":938,"y":1544,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"명확하고","x":1011,"y":1544,"width":117,"height":32},{"text":"간결하게","x":1140,"y":1544,"width":115,"height":32},{"text":"나타낼","x":1270,"y":1544,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"수","x":1370,"y":1544,"width":31,"height":31},{"text":"있","x":1415,"y":1543,"width":27,"height":32}]},{"text":"다는 장점이 있다. 그러나 일반적으로 순환은 함수 호출을 하게 되므로 반복에 비해 수행속도 면","words":[{"text":"다는","x":176,"y":1595,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"장점이","x":244,"y":1596,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"있다.","x":343,"y":1596,"width":62,"height":32},{"text":"그러나","x":419,"y":1596,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"일반적으로","x":519,"y":1596,"width":146,"height":31},{"text":"순환은","x":676,"y":1598,"width":90,"height":30},{"text":"함수","x":776,"y":1598,"width":60,"height":31},{"text":"호출을","x":846,"y":1598,"width":90,"height":31},{"text":"하게","x":946,"y":1598,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"되므로","x":1017,"y":1598,"width":88,"height":31},{"text":"반복에","x":1116,"y":1598,"width":86,"height":31},{"text":"비해","x":1216,"y":1598,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"수행속도","x